place it against the panel's own reference points, measured by `PANELCEIL`
(`TRAINING-PANEL-CEILINGS-2026-09-10.md`, `/home/sat/mcrl-v025-ceiling30-ws`), on the
**declared full-buffer numerator, no demand cap**:

