## The reading, fixed before you run

- **Learned `a0` below `11.027760`** — the learned proposal is worse than a zero-learning
  geometric assignment. Report that plainly; it is the sibling project's documented signature.
- **`a0` at or near `11.027760`** — the heads add nothing over geometry.
- **`a0` materially above it** — report how much of the `13.430253` strong-static ceiling is
  recovered.
- **z versus non-z** — report the difference in `a0` EE and in `modal_frac`/`active`
  side by side. **If z changes concentration but not EE, or EE but not concentration, say so;
  do not merge them into one story.**

